  "body": "## Scope and disposition\n\nCredited companion consequence for **5100016 / AMR-050-0016, k304**. Both arXiv v11 Table 4 and the final published Table 4 specify the signed-area ratio **A'/A'_M**, for primitive period N divisible by 4 and every fixed real M. Here A' is the outer tangent polygon's signed area, and A'_M is the pedal area formed by projecting M to that polygon's side lines.\n\nThe reviewed proof establishes a division-free identity A'_M = (c0 + c2 |M|\u00b2) A' along each strict elliptical-caustic family. The source ratio is constant on its natural domain.\n\n- For convex families the pedal denominator is positive for every M\n- For N = 4 the ratio is exactly 2, including the all-four-singular-edge complex-pole case\n- An exact admissible primitive star family has a circle of fixed M for which A'_M vanishes identically while A' is nonzero. The raw quotient is undefined there; this is a domain qualification, not a refutation of invariance where defined\n- Least-period, fixed-M, signed traversal areas and strict nondegenerate confocal elliptical caustics are retained\n\nQUEUE marks only this target **already_solved, 1/5**, as a credited consequence of classical Jacobi geometry and the previously developed radial/pole mechanisms, not a new-discovery or historical-priority claim. Prior companion work in PRs #201, #203, #204 and #250 is explicitly credited. Their different parity conclusions are not silently substituted.\n\n## Artifacts and validation\n\nThe unchanged author packet includes the complete proof, exact source/prior-work audit, domain certificate, exact checker, numerical diagnostics and frozen manifest. Seven unchanged independent-review files are added under independent_review/.\n\nThe separate adversarial AI review gives **PASS_COMPLETE_NATURAL_DOMAIN_TARGET**, with no correction. It verifies all eleven author files and three source PDF hashes, replays both author receipts, and independently passes 9,856 exact controls plus 2,046 separately labeled numerical diagnostics. The author controls comprise 11,278 exact assertions and 2,475 numerical diagnostics; none replaces the analytic proof.\n\nBinding hashes:\n- PROOF.md: f4a3dd4fda0f67f26c3ebb74df48354c180636d3556e4ebbf66aa2840b024983\n- Author manifest: 454c38c315e62d06ace8234da8fcfbce8b17072d9562dfc57bfeb060570e5ade\n- Independent review: 559924b6ff542c91f2d27208770f6e08fd3f6bebd838f6d8c53bbc61082211e1\n- Review manifest: f5a750fd68df997880a866112aa77a8b6946e4ded097b5ac34b8b85cd688d213\n\nThe original frozen candidate-status metadata is preserved as history; the later independent review and this single-row QUEUE update record disposition. This is an unrefereed AI-assisted research draft. Source PDFs, reading copies and unrelated work are excluded.",
